From: Bariccatti <bariccatti@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Apr 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] DUO-DE Launcher3 dual-screen modifications

NOTE: This patch is specific to the LineageOS 23.2 Launcher3 codebase
(https://github.com/LineageOS/android_packages_apps_Launcher3, branch lineage-23.2).
Infinity X ships this fork via LFS. It will NOT apply to AOSP's Launcher3.
Key differences: uses mDeviceProperties.getHeightPx()/getWidthPx() instead of
direct fields, allAppsTopPadding, simpler ActivityOptionsWrapper, etc.
- All Apps drawer scales to partial height in spanned mode
- Left/right screen alignment based on touch position
- Freeform mode for app launching on dual-screen
